   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The outermost operation is a quotient with numerator \\( \\cos^{3}(2x) \\) and denominator \\( e^{x} \\), so the quotient rule comes first (equivalently, rewrite \\( f \\) as a product with the factor \\( e^{-x} \\)).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
