                  2
               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "Assemble the quotient rule: \\( f'(x) = \\left(- 6 e^{x} \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)} - e^{x} \\cos^{3}{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right) e^{- 2 x} \\).",
